OL,3,GNEWSAGlass heritage 'on its knees',
OL,4,Acampaigners warn
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlassmakers have warned Britain's glass
OL,7,Fheritage is "on its knees" and urged
OL,8,Fthat there be a "fundamental rethink"
OL,9,Fof funding.
OL,11,FCampaigners in Sunderland and
OL,12,FStourbridge said glass heritage was
OL,13,F"being allowed to disappear", and
OL,14,Fcalled on the government to invest in
OL,15,Finstitutions across the country which
OL,16,Ftry to preserve it.
OL,18,FIt comes as the National Glass Centre
OL,19,Fin Sunderland closed its doors in July
OL,20,Fover "unaffordable" repair costs, put
OL,21,Fat put at between #14m and #45m.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
