OL,3,GNEWSAGlass heritage 'on its knees',
OL,4,Acampaigners warn
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Culture, Media and
OL,7,FSport (DCMS) said it was committed to
OL,8,Fensuring museums were fit for the
OL,9,Ffuture, with #160m of funding dedicated
OL,10,Fto local museums.
